It occurs to me that given the new notes/templates features along
with the sibling feature, it would probably be a good idea to
completely redo at the very least the gismu deck.  Because that way
you could have the full (short/flashcard) definition (x1 goes to x2
via ...) plus the per-place cards (le klama => a goer) all generated
from one note, and then the sibling feature can be used to keep them
all apart from each other so they don't come up on the same day.

OTOH, I don't want to start again.  :P

I suppose this would be a good time to go with my plan to do the
gismu list in Lojban!  :D

